  "agent_notes": [
    "The official contact page identifies the Jaipur campus at Via Dadi Ka Phatak, Benar Rd, Shankar Vihar Extension, Jamna Puri, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302013.",
    "The current 2026-2027 admission form lists seven regular B.Tech choices, MCA, two M.Tech choices, and PhD (Computer Science). Lateral-entry choices were treated as admission routes for the same B.Tech degrees, not duplicate programmes.",
    "The admission form also contains BCA, B.Com, B.Sc., B.Ed., M.Ed., and pharmacy choices; these were excluded because the shared group site identifies separate pharmacy, teacher-training, and PG Mahavidyalaya institutions rather than this SBCET engineering campus.",
    "The Mechanical Engineering page separately states that the department is offering M.Tech courses in Production Engineering, but the current 2026-2027 admission form does not list that programme. It is included as a candidate course and the catalogue is marked partial/manual review pending confirmation.",
    "PhD (Computer Science) appears in the current admission form and in the institution-level description, but no standalone doctoral catalogue page was found.",
    "The managed proxy produced the exact self-signed certificate-chain error on normal TLS; curl --insecure was used only for public GET requests after confirming the expected official/search hostnames.",
    "No separate duration or eligibility facts were added except the MCA page's explicit two-year statement."
